# NOT REAL ASSETS. These are screenshots of this site's own dashed placeholder
# frames, saved into public/ as if they were supplied photography and product
# shots. Proven by colour histogram: the pixels are --color-bg (#0a0a0b),
# --color-line (#26262b) and --color-muted (#8c8c95), 149-207 unique colours,
# standard deviation ~0.01. The four about/* files are byte-identical to each
# other, as are the four food/* files. Wiring them in would replace eight
# intentional dashed frames with eight flat black rectangles.
# Real assets belong in src/assets/images/ and are registered in src/lib/images.ts.
# See docs/orchestration/SESSION_STATE.md.
public/images/about/
public/images/food/
public/images/projects/

